Cell["\<\
\:6bcf\:7ec4 benchmark \:5148\:7531 m\[Chi]1\:3001ms\:3001\[CapitalDelta]m \
\:548c g2 \:8ba1\:7b97\:6781\:70b9\:90e8\:5206\:5bbd\:5ea6 \[CapitalGamma](\
\[Chi]2\[RightArrow]\[Chi]1s)\:ff0c\:518d\:628a\:8be5\:7ec4\:7684\:5bbd\:5ea6\
