verification\\r\\nModel Version: 1.0\\r\\nFor more information, type \
ModelInformation[].\\r\\n\\r\\n   - Loading particle classes.\\r\\n   - \
Loading parameter classes.\\r\\n\\r\\nModel InelasticScalarRadiation \
loaded.\\r\\nLAGRANGIAN: gS*scal*chiOnebar . chiTwo + gS*scal*chiTwobar . \
chiOne + gX*chiOnebar . Ga[mu] . chiTwo*med[mu] + gX*chiTwobar . Ga[mu] . \
chiOne*med[mu] + gN*nucbar . Ga[mu] . nuc*med[mu]\\r\\nStarting Feynman rule \
calculation.\\r\\nExpanding the Lagrangian...\\r\\nCollecting the different \
structures that enter the vertex.\\r\\n5 possible non-zero vertices have been \
found -> starting the computation: Dynamic[FR$FeynmanRules] / 5.\\r\\n5 \
vertices obtained.\\r\\nRULE COUNT: 5\\r\\nRULES: {{{{chiOnebar, 1}, {chiTwo, \
2}, {scal, 3}}, I*gS*IndexDelta[Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}, \
{{{chiTwobar, 1}, {chiOne, 2}, {scal, 3}}, I*gS*IndexDelta[Index[Spin, \
Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}, {{{chiOnebar, 1}, {chiTwo, 2}, {med, 3}}, \
I*gX*Ga[Index[Lorentz, Ext[3]], Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}, \
{{{chiTwobar, 1}, {chiOne, 2}, {med, 3}}, I*gX*Ga[Index[Lorentz, Ext[3]], \
Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}, {{{nucbar, 1}, {nuc, 2}, {med, \
3}}, I*gN*Ga[Index[Lorentz, Ext[3]], Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, \
Ext[2]]]}}\\r\\nSCALAR, VECTOR, NUCLEON COUNTS: {2, 2, 1}\\r\\nSCALAR \
STRUCTURE OK: True\\r\\nVECTOR STRUCTURE OK: True\\r\\nSCALAR COEFFICIENTS: \
{IndexDelta[Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]], IndexDelta[Index[Spin, \
Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}\\r\\nVECTOR COEFFICIENTS: {Ga[Index[Lorentz, \
Ext[3]], Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]], Ga[Index[Lorentz, \
Ext[3]], Index[Spin, Ext[1]], Index[Spin, Ext[2]]]}\\r\\nChecking for \
hermiticity by calculating the Feynman rules contained in L-HC[L].\\r\\nIf \
the lagrangian is hermitian, then the number of vertices should be \
zero.\\r\\nStarting Feynman rule calculation.\\r\\nExpanding the \
Lagrangian...\\r\\nNo vertices found.\\r\\n0 vertices obtained.\\r\\nThe \
lagrangian is hermitian.\\r\\nHERMITICITY RESULT: {}\\r\\nCHECK: PASS\\r\\n\"\
\>"], "Print",
